# Field Forms (coaching/asset app) has its own separate repo, Dockerfile, and
# docker-compose.yml, deployed as its own stack - this repo's docker-compose.yml
# never builds from apps/field-forms, and it has no deps installed in this
# repo's own node_modules, so leaving it in the build context only breaks
# `next build`'s whole-tree TypeScript check for no benefit.
apps/field-forms
